 will be different from their  previous incarnation and the iranian  leadership will try to have and exert  influence which will almost certainly  lead to its cooperation with the taliban  afghanistan's new leaders certainly at  the moment are seeking to gain  international recognition most states  are still trying to work out how to  respond  but what happens next will once again  not be decided only by those inside the  country  outside actors as they have all too  often in the past in what could come to  be known as the new great game will also  be shaping afghanistan's future
 

